msgstr "تشغيل الدوائر الديناميكية مع DD و `MidCircuitMeasure`\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/tutorials/dc-hex-ising/extracted-outputs/662239cf-0.avif)\n"
